  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Opt-in XInclude expansion of the principal source document (XsltTransformer.EnableXInclude), via Core's XIncludeProcessor: xi:include (parse=\"xml\"/\"text\") and xi:fallback are supported, so base-uri() of included nodes reports the included file's origin. xsl:copy/xsl:copy-of of source nodes into a temporary tree now build the copy directly in the XDM node model (not serialize-and-reparse), so copy-namespaces=\"no\"/inherit-namespaces=\"no\" produce the correct in-scope namespaces and a copied element's base URI is preserved. fn:xml-to-json emits canonical JSON numbers and escapes DEL/C1 controls and the solidus. Multilingual xsl:number (including German cardinals/ordinals) and composite xsl:for-each-group grouping keys. Hardening for untrusted input: a stylesheet nesting-depth bound (deeply nested stylesheets fail with a catchable error rather than overflowing the stack) and an internal-entity expansion cap on the source/document() parse paths. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.3.0 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.6.0. No breaking API changes. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
